flowchart TB
accTitle: Prevention, findings management and response are separate
accDescr: Control Tower governs member accounts, Security Hub CSPM centralizes covered findings, and EventBridge invokes explicitly configured response workflows.
C[Control Tower controls]:::decision -->|Prevent and detect| A[Governed member accounts]:::inputData
A -->|Supported findings| H[Security Hub CSPM<br/>Security member account]:::decision
P[Central configuration<br/>Account / OU policies<br/>Home + linked Regions]:::inputData --> H
H --> E{EventBridge rule<br/>Finding matches?}:::decision
E -->|Yes| R[Authorized response workflow]:::output
R --> V[Verify remediation result]:::output
